### Roteiro de teste (IntelliJ HTTP Client). Rode na ordem.

### 1. Cadastrar organizador (público)
POST http://localhost:8080/organizadores
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Ana Organizadora", "email": "ana@org.com", "senha": "123456" }

### 2. Login do organizador -> guarda o token
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/organizadores/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@org.com", "senha": "123456" }

> {% client.global.set("tokenOrg", response.body.token); %}

### 3. Criar evento (só organizador)
POST http://localhost:8080/eventos
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenOrg}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Semana de TI", "descricao": "Palestras", "local": "Auditório",
  "data": "2027-05-10", "hora": "19:00:00", "capacidade": 50 }

### 4. Cadastrar participante (público)
POST http://localhost:8080/participantes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Bruno", "email": "bruno@mail.com", "senha": "abcdef" }

### 5. Login do participante -> guarda o token
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/participantes/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bruno@mail.com", "senha": "abcdef" }

> {% client.global.set("tokenPart", response.body.token); %}

### 6. Participante vê o próprio cadastro (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/participantes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPart}}

### 7. Participante tentando criar evento (403)
POST http://localhost:8080/eventos
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPart}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "X", "descricao": "X", "local": "X", "data": "2027-05-10", "hora": "19:00:00", "capacidade": 1 }

### 8. Sem token em rota protegida (401)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/eventos/1

### 9. Organizador lista participantes (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/participantes?eventoId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenOrg}}

### 10. Participante emite o próprio ticket para o evento 1 (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPart}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "participanteId": 1, "eventoId": 1 }

### 11. Mesmo participante, mesmo evento de novo (409)
POST http://localhost:8080/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPart}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "participanteId": 1, "eventoId": 1 }

### 12. Criar o evento 2 com capacidade 1 (só organizador)
POST http://localhost:8080/eventos
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenOrg}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Workshop Kotlin", "descricao": "Vagas limitadas", "local": "Lab 3",
  "data": "2027-06-15", "hora": "14:00:00", "capacidade": 1 }

### 13. Mesmo participante em outro evento (201) -> 1 participante, 2 tickets
POST http://localhost:8080/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPart}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "participanteId": 1, "eventoId": 2 }

### 14. Cadastrar segundo participante
POST http://localhost:8080/participantes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Carla", "email": "carla@mail.com", "senha": "abcdef" }

### 15. Login da Carla -> guarda o token
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/participantes/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "carla@mail.com", "senha": "abcdef" }

> {% client.global.set("tokenCarla", response.body.token); %}

### 16. Evento 2 já lotado (409)
POST http://localhost:8080/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCarla}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "participanteId": 2, "eventoId": 2 }

### 17. Carla tentando emitir ticket em nome do Bruno (403)
POST http://localhost:8080/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCarla}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "participanteId": 1, "eventoId": 1 }

### 18. Carla emite o próprio ticket para o evento 1 (201) -> evento 1 com 2 tickets
POST http://localhost:8080/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCarla}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "participanteId": 2, "eventoId": 1 }

### 19. Organizador reduz capacidade do evento 1 para 1, abaixo dos 2 tickets emitidos (409)
PUT http://localhost:8080/eventos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenOrg}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Semana de TI", "descricao": "Palestras", "local": "Auditório",
  "data": "2027-05-10", "hora": "19:00:00", "capacidade": 1 }

### 20. Participante vê o próprio ticket (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPart}}

### 21. Participante tentando listar todos os tickets (403)
GET http://localhost:8080/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPart}}

### 22. Organizador lista tickets do evento 2 (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/tickets?eventoId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenOrg}}

### 23. Organizador lista participantes do evento 1 (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/participantes?eventoId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenOrg}}

### 24. Cancelar o ticket do evento 2, liberando a vaga (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tickets/2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPart}}

### 25. Agora a Carla consegue o ticket do evento 2 (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCarla}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "participanteId": 2, "eventoId": 2 }
